    "content": "<!-- Load Facebook SDK for JavaScript -->\n      <!-- Your Chat Plugin code -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Contact info</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');\n  .transit-footer-hub {\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 35px;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .branch-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 8px;\n    border-left: 2px solid rgba(169, 50, 38, 0.4);\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .branch-block:hover {\n    border-left: 2px solid #A93226;\n    padding-left: 25px;\n  }\n  .city-name {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    color: #FFFFFF !important; /* Force Bright White */\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .detail-group {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .detail-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #FFFFFF !important; /* Force Bright White */\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n  .detail-text a {\n    color: inherit;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  /* --- MOBILE STACKING LOGIC --- */\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .transit-footer-hub {\n      gap: 30px;\n      padding-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .branch-block {\n      padding-left: 15px;\n      border-left-width: 3px;\n    }\n    .city-name {\n      font-size: 17px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n    Kathmandu (Head Office)\n      Purple House, Level 2, Bagbazar\n      01-5906277 | 970-3722229 | 9851315991\n      <a href=\"mailto:info@transiteducation.com.np\">info@transiteducation.com.np</a>\n    Itahari\n      Rano Complex, Sangit Chowk\n      025-590570 | 9851160433\n      <a href=\"mailto:itahari@transiteducation.com.np\">itahari@transiteducation.com.np</a>\n    Damak\n      Dipini Marg, Near Sagarmatha Petrol Pump\n      023-577162 | 9804324556\